updainium installs the GUI application under tools/updainium/.

    Linux:   tools/updainium/Updainium.AppImage   (needs FUSE, or --appimage-extract-and-run)
    Windows: tools/updainium/Updainium.exe
    macOS:   open tools/updainium/Updainium.app

The installed app fetches release information from upstream at runtime; it is
not a C/C++ library and provides no headers or CMake targets.
